. With only one card to come and limited improvement possibilities, continuing is -EV. Since I'm already ahead in the overall match (+17,100 cumulative), the optimal strategy is to minimize losses on weak hands and preserve my chip lead. Folding here is the disciplined, +EV decision in the context of the match.\n\nAnswer: -1"}
